<!-- Official TIDAL icon: the four-diamond mark (a row of three with one below
     center) on TIDAL's black rounded-tile (their app-icon treatment) so it
     reads on any background without per-site tinting, matching the
     self-contained Spotify/Apple/Deezer badge marks. Diamond geometry is
     verbatim from TIDAL's brand EPS (TIDAL Icon/RGB/EPS/icon-black-rgb.eps,
     bbox 141.7323x94.4926), centered in a 189x189 tile (r=42 ≈ 22%) — the
     diamond coordinates below are pre-translated by (+23.635,+47.25) since a
     vector drawable can't group-transform. Geometrically identical to the web
     TidalGlyph and the iOS TidalLogo.imageset; keep the three in sync. -->
